"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>24"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"よくこんなに集めたでなぁ "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" なかなか独特の雰囲気！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/a/6/a638deae.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/7/6/76b81a0f.jpg"}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>26"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"儲けあるんかなこういうの "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" こちらは中古タイヤ市場 相模原店の敷地内にある自販機コーナー"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"待ち時間を過ごすお客さん向けにうどん自販機を設置したのが始まりなんやって"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ホイールが大量にあるね！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/a/6/a60ac61a.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/1/9/1972273a.jpg"}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>38"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"服可愛いな"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"自分でデザインしてるん "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>41"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"服は既存の服やけど、組み合わせてコーディネートは自分でしてる！ "}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>43"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"センスいいよな"}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" シルバーブロンドは寒い季節が似合う "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" せっかくなので、まずは肉そばを食べてみよう！"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"お値段は500円"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/6/4/64871412.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/0/6/06c10484.jpg"}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 古い自販機のメンテナンス大変だろうな "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 料理は中古タイヤ市場の店員さんが自分たちで食材を取り寄せて盛り付けて自販機にセットしてるんやって"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"あったかくておいしい！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/0/8/08ea71d9.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/c/4/c401f3ae.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" こちらはラーメン"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"こっちもあつあつ！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/1/f/1f727916.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/8/6/86ea39f9.jpg"}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>74"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"美味かったか? "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>78"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"思ったよりあったかくてうまかったで！ "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 引き続きレトロ自販機を見ていこう！"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ご当地カレーとフリスクの自販機"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/1/0/1030a4e0.jpg"}]],"comments":["本業は中古タイヤ屋さんという","私には理解できない世界だわ\n否定はしてない","遠方からレトロ自販機目当てに人が来るから採算は取れるんじゃないかな？\nメンテがめっちゃ大変そうだけどね"]}